  <body>
    <div>
      <p begin="00:14.620" end="00:18.080" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">When you became a stranger (stranger)</p>
      <p begin="00:18.080" end="00:21.750" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I knew that you'd be leaving me (I knew that you'd be leaving me)</p>
      <p begin="00:21.750" end="00:25.120" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">Then you became a danger (danger)</p>
      <p begin="00:25.120" end="00:28.510" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I felt sadness pour into me (I felt sadness pour into me)</p>
      <p begin="00:28.510" end="00:32.520" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I'd do anything just for you to be mines again (be mines again)</p>
      <p begin="00:32.520" end="00:35.900" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">But now I have to wait for you (wait for you)</p>
      <p begin="00:35.900" end="00:39.780" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I'd do anything just for me to see you again (see you again)</p>
      <p begin="00:39.780" end="00:43.750" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">I felt sadness pour into me (pour into me)</p>
